OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy and 
OL,6,Fwet evening for Orkney with some       
OL,7,Fpersistent rain overnight. Shetland    
OL,8,Fseeing clear spells for the early part 
OL,9,Fof the evening before clouding over    
OL,10,Flater but mostly dry.                  
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet start for Orkney,     
OL,13,Fcloudy but mostly dry for Shetland,    
OL,14,Frain perhaps skirting the islands.     
OL,15,FRain becoming light and patchy for     
OL,16,FOrkney during the day, still quite     
OL,17,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
