OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:      
OL,6,FShowery with bright spells on          
OL,7,FThursday, wet and windy on Friday and  
OL,8,Fquite cold again, further unsettled    
OL,9,Fshowery conditions into the weekend.   
